{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2023-02-03 06:20:00', 'title': 'ENERGY STORAGE, ELECTRONICS AND MANUFACTURING DRIVE RECORD YEAR FOR LINDE SMALL ON-SITE PROJECTS', 'text': 'WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / FEBRUARY 3, 2023 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAD ANOTHER RECORD YEAR FOR NEW SMALL ON-SITE PROJECTS DURING 2022. LINDE SIGNED 52 NEW SMALL ON-SITE PROJECTS FOR THE SUPPLY OF NITROGEN AND OXYGEN, A 21% INCREASE COMPARED WITH 2021.'}